OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do farmers want to build
OL,4,Areservoirs and what's stopping them?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the face of climate change, farmers
OL,7,Fare calling for less red tape and more
OL,8,Fgovernment funding to help them build
OL,9,Freservoirs on their land.
OL,11,FThey say storing more water on farmland
OL,12,Fcould help reduce flooding in the
OL,13,Fwinter, minimise the impact of drought
OL,14,Fin the summer and provide food
OL,15,Fsecurity.
OL,17,FThe reservoirs would hold winter
OL,18,Frainwater to be used on their crops in
OL,19,Fsummer.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
