OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do farmers want to build
OL,4,Areservoirs and what's stopping them?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust 34 on-farm reservoirs have been
OL,7,Fbuilt in England in the last five
OL,8,Fyears.
